WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:07.033
The king drummed his fingers on his throne, looking at his wife.

2
00:00:07.053 --> 00:00:08.714
"How can we make Ellen cry?"

3
00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:10.975
"It's impossible."

4
00:00:10.995 --> 00:00:11.795
The queen sighed.

5
00:00:11.955 --> 00:00:13.956
"All she does is laugh."

6
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.701
But the queen soon came up with another idea.

7
00:00:35.242 --> 00:00:38.222
The next day a beggar arrived at the palace.

8
00:00:39.303 --> 00:00:41.043
His clothes were rags.

9
00:00:41.603 --> 00:00:43.644
His face was streaked with dirt.

10
00:00:44.284 --> 00:00:46.525
A servant led Ellen into the room.

11
00:00:49.746 --> 00:00:50.646
"Yes, Papa?"

12
00:00:51.026 --> 00:00:51.626
Ellen said.

13
00:00:52.566 --> 00:00:54.487
The king introduced the beggar.

14
00:00:54.507 --> 00:00:58.208
"This man has had a hard life.

15
00:00:58.732 --> 00:01:00.493
He would like to tell you some stories."

16
00:01:01.073 --> 00:01:02.534
The king turned to the beggar.

17
00:01:02.554 --> 00:01:05.635
"Please tell us your saddest tales."

18
00:01:08.076 --> 00:01:12.218
For the next hour, the beggar told Ellen about being poor.

19
00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.819
"Every night I go to bed hungry.

20
00:01:18.081 --> 00:01:19.722
I sleep in the cold.

21
00:01:20.582 --> 00:01:23.423
Some days I eat only a few crumbs."

22
00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:33.021
Tears fell from the queen's eyes.

23
00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:35.321
"How sad."

24
00:01:36.182 --> 00:01:37.462
She glanced at her daughter.

25
00:01:38.322 --> 00:01:39.562
Ellen was looking down.

26
00:01:40.423 --> 00:01:43.083
A sound was bubbling up from her chest.

27
00:01:46.764 --> 00:01:48.245
The queen's face lit up.

28
00:01:49.425 --> 00:01:52.146
"My idea is working," she thought.

29
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:55.427
"The princess is sobbing!"

30
00:01:56.827 --> 00:02:00.168
But the sound bursting from Ellen was not a sob.

31
00:02:01.185 --> 00:02:02.366
It was a giggle.

32
00:02:06.989 --> 00:02:10.392
A second later the princess was screaming with laughter.

33
00:02:13.855 --> 00:02:17.138
The king and queen groaned as a servant took her away.

34
00:02:17.158 --> 00:02:19.840
"What will we do?"

35
00:02:20.341 --> 00:02:21.181
the king asked.

36
00:02:25.585 --> 00:02:28.628
The next day the desperate parents tried something else.

37
00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.482
They marched upstairs to the princess' bedroom.

38
00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:43.628
Then they yelled at her in their loudest, meanest voices.

39
00:02:43.688 --> 00:02:44.728
The princess' lip quivered.

40
00:02:44.828 --> 00:02:46.349
And then She burst into laughter.

41
00:02:58.684 --> 00:03:02.625
Now, around this time, a handsome prince was looking for a wife.

42
00:03:03.345 --> 00:03:06.886
The prince was brave and kind, and many women loved him.

43
00:03:08.827 --> 00:03:11.488
Yet the prince didn't love any of them back.

44
00:03:15.249 --> 00:03:19.510
will travel to another kingdom," he decided at last.

45
00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:22.811
"Perhaps I can find the right princess there.

46
00:03:22.831 --> 00:03:26.812
I want a wife who makes me laugh and feel happy."

47
00:03:35.736 --> 00:03:38.078
One afternoon he was riding along a lake.

48
00:03:41.882 --> 00:03:44.044
a lovely lake," the prince thought.

49
00:03:44.064 --> 00:03:48.128
"Ahh!" someone shrieked.

50
00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:52.452
The prince jumped off his horse and ran to the water's edge.

51
00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:56.916
In the center of the lake, a woman was drowning!
